# Optimizer facade.
#
# Public import: importa ex "gradus:optimize" privata optimize
# Depends on: gradus:tensor
#
# Will split into nested leaves when ≥2 optimizers are implemented:
#   gradus:optimize/sgd       SGD with momentum
#   gradus:optimize/adam      Adam optimizer
#   gradus:optimize/schedule  learning-rate schedules (warmup, cosine decay)
#
# Architectural rule: optimizers consume raw parameter tensors and gradient
# tensors. They do not know about layer abstractions or architectures. This
# module must not import from gradus:nn, gradus:attention, or gradus:transformer.
